/*
 * TWO-25326: `w-full min-w-0` on the tile's own
 * root, not present before this fix.
 *
 * Reported only with company search IN THE TILE
 * ($isCompanySearchInPaymentTile true): the tile then renders substantial
 * markup with real content (the search field and its absolutely-positioned
 * dropdown) in place of the near-empty hidden inputs the text-only mode
