             * agree. This supersedes the earlier gate, which showed the label
             * whenever a company number had been captured.
             *
             * The label is consequently NOT a swap with the tile's company
             * controls any more either. TWO-25326: the search control's
             * visibility is no longer conditioned on capture at all — it is
             * decided solely by the admin setting that says WHERE the one
             * control renders. The "Change company" button that used to sit
             * beside this label, as the only route back out of a hidden search
