             * the buyer's route to a different company at every point, exactly
             * as it is before any company is captured.
             *
             * Both bindings are bare getter names: this file's CSP-friendly
             * Alpine build looks a bound expression up as a key on the
             * component rather than evaluating it, so `companyTileLabelText`
             * does the concatenation in JS.
             */
            ?>
            <div class="two-company-tile-label-row flex items-center gap-2">
