             * pick a different company), and it appears without the buyer
             * having asked for anything.
             *
             * Unconditional, with no brand switch of its own — the two notices
             * above are brand-configurable COPY (a brand may have nothing it
             * wants said about an approval), whereas this text is the existing
             * `generalErrorMessage`/error-response wording the toast already
